WEBVTT

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:24.650
--The Song Princess is amazing.
--Whoever is assigned to her will gain prestige.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:30.030
I think she could even take
home the Moldova Trophy.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.708
This school is the same...

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.799
I will <i>not </i>quit the Library Club.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:51.760
Do you understand what you are saying?

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.262
Yes.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:01.812
Anyway, that's how it is, so please leave.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.106
Misono!

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:17.369
Sorry for the disturbance.
I will make sure it does not happen again.

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:21.623
You're skipping singing practice?

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.667
No.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:24.877
Then why?

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:28.463
But you aren't practicing enough, are you?
We're fine here, so--

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:32.050
I am practicing enough. There's no problem.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:36.722
No, the teacher barged in
because there <i>is </i>a problem, right?

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:42.477
Why did you come to
this school in the first place?

00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:45.022
If you have talent,

00:01:45.022 --> 00:01:50.986
I think it's wrong not to take advantage
of the opportunity to cultivate it.

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:54.907
Sakuraba, I'm sure Senri
has her own way of thinking...

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.867
Excuse me.

00:02:09.213 --> 00:02:11.215
Kodachi.

00:02:11.215 --> 00:02:13.717
It's Shepherd's work from here on out.

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:16.220
I'll take over from here.

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:31.568
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:34.321
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:39.660
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:45.123
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:46.500
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.420
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.257
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:02:53.257 --> 00:02:55.926
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:02:55.926 --> 00:02:59.972
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:02:59.972 --> 00:03:05.602
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:03:05.602 --> 00:03:06.728
<i>All Right</i>

00:03:06.728 --> 00:03:09.940
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.776
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:13.777
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:03:13.777 --> 00:03:17.447
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:03:17.447 --> 00:03:23.370
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.206
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:29.918
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:37.676
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:03:48.687 --> 00:03:50.480
"Episode 9: The Song Princess' Decision"
Misono is currently standing

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.358
"Episode 9: The Song Princess' Decision"
at an important crossroads in her life.

00:03:53.358 --> 00:03:57.029
At this rate, she might quit singing forever.

00:03:57.029 --> 00:03:58.572
Quit singing...?

00:04:00.407 --> 00:04:05.078
Right now, the question is, how long
is she going to drag things out for, though.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:06.955
Did something happen?

00:04:07.456 --> 00:04:09.291
Huh?

00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:10.751
To Misono.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.671
Anyway, just leave the rest to me.

00:04:15.631 --> 00:04:17.591
Wait a minute.

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:20.761
Tell me more about what's going on.

00:04:20.761 --> 00:04:22.679
Why should I?

00:04:22.679 --> 00:04:27.935
Why? No particular reason.
I just can't leave things like this.

00:05:43.177 --> 00:05:46.263
You don't have to keep singing.

00:05:48.724 --> 00:05:50.475
Kakei...

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.062
Are you okay?

00:05:54.062 --> 00:05:56.023
Uh, yes.

00:06:00.235 --> 00:06:02.571
Thank you.

00:06:12.873 --> 00:06:16.627
I always practice here.

00:06:18.337 --> 00:06:21.173
It's the same no matter where I sing.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:26.803
I don't know why I sing anymore...

00:06:35.771 --> 00:06:41.401
When I was little,
I was happy just to be singing.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.451
I could sing forever by myself.

00:06:50.202 --> 00:06:52.496
Singing was fun.

00:06:54.665 --> 00:06:57.167
I made a friend who liked singing, too.

00:06:59.086 --> 00:07:02.130
We would always sing together.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.508
It was fun.

00:07:04.508 --> 00:07:09.930
She was my dear friend,
and I could work hard with her.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.891
We were both happy.

00:07:12.891 --> 00:07:14.643
But...

00:07:27.114 --> 00:07:29.616
If you win here...

00:07:32.411 --> 00:07:37.666
...that girl really will quit this time.

00:07:41.378 --> 00:07:44.423
I definitely didn't want that to happen.

00:07:44.423 --> 00:07:46.091
So...

00:07:47.301 --> 00:07:51.847
So I didn't give it my all.

00:07:54.349 --> 00:07:56.143
Even so...

00:07:58.437 --> 00:08:03.442
I still won.

00:08:06.236 --> 00:08:09.448
Senri... Why?

00:08:11.742 --> 00:08:13.577
Why...?

00:08:17.206 --> 00:08:20.417
Why didn't you do your best?

00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:27.591
What I got from losing my friend
was the nickname "Song Princess."

00:08:28.425 --> 00:08:33.096
And then I was alone.

00:08:39.978 --> 00:08:45.567
I'd hoped that if I came to Shiomi,
something might change.

00:08:45.567 --> 00:08:47.861
But it was the same.

00:08:50.405 --> 00:08:53.867
I just liked to sing.

00:08:53.867 --> 00:08:57.079
Why did things turn out like this?

00:08:57.079 --> 00:09:00.123
Now, it's just painful to sing...

00:09:00.123 --> 00:09:01.917
It's hard...

00:09:04.503 --> 00:09:07.673
Then why don't you just stop?

00:09:07.673 --> 00:09:10.342
Huh?

00:09:10.342 --> 00:09:14.680
If it's painful, there's no reason
to force yourself to continue.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.183
There's no point if you hurt yourself.

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.396
Besides, you're still you,
even if you aren't the Song Princess.

00:09:24.147 --> 00:09:27.693
The Library Club doesn't
care about that stuff, remember?

00:09:28.652 --> 00:09:35.909
Why don't you use the time you would've spent
practicing to watch a movie or go shopping?

00:09:35.909 --> 00:09:40.080
Or, if you want to read,
I'll read with you as much as you want.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.125
That might be nice, too.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.720
Misono has decided to quit singing.

00:09:56.013 --> 00:09:58.223
Really?

00:09:58.223 --> 00:10:01.810
What'll happen if she drops out of school?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.062
If that happens...

00:10:04.062 --> 00:10:06.857
That was a big decision.

00:10:06.857 --> 00:10:12.905
I'm sure you're all worried,
but will you leave this to me?

00:10:21.705 --> 00:10:24.082
What do you plan on doing?

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:27.753
Life isn't just about singing.

00:10:27.753 --> 00:10:29.963
What are you saying?

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:35.511
Leave the rest to me. You should
try doing what you want, too.

00:10:38.096 --> 00:10:39.765
Like I could.

00:10:44.228 --> 00:10:46.480
Open wide!

00:10:47.022 --> 00:10:52.069
I know I said I'd do anything,
but this is embarrassing.

00:10:52.069 --> 00:10:54.613
I've always wanted to try this once.

00:10:54.613 --> 00:10:56.782
Now it's my turn.

00:11:20.305 --> 00:11:22.057
"From the Shepherd"

00:11:23.183 --> 00:11:29.273
Mochizuki, I'll make Shiomi
into the best school ever.

00:11:43.745 --> 00:11:49.209
Oh, right. I don't have to
practice in the mornings anymore.

00:12:02.306 --> 00:12:04.558
"The Queen's New Clothes"?

00:12:05.893 --> 00:12:09.313
Hey, which is the boy you like?

00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:16.653
Huh? Um, um, um... Wait a minute.

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:27.748
Oh, right! The Library Club
is putting on a big event soon.

00:12:27.748 --> 00:12:30.375
Really? What's it called?

00:12:32.127 --> 00:12:33.795
"Minafes"

00:12:33.795 --> 00:12:38.383
How about calling it the Minazuki
Festival where everyone can have fun...

00:12:38.383 --> 00:12:40.802
...or Minafes for short?

00:12:41.929 --> 00:12:43.430
Minafes, huh?

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.265
It's easy to say and easy to remember.

00:12:45.265 --> 00:12:47.351
As expected, Shirasaki!

00:12:47.351 --> 00:12:52.022
I thought of it thanks to my sister, Sayori.

00:12:52.022 --> 00:12:55.317
Then we need to thank her later.

00:12:58.779 --> 00:13:03.867
Well, let's take a picture to commemorate
deciding on the name of the event.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:07.788
"Minafes"

00:13:09.706 --> 00:13:13.210
"Today's Plans: Sleep in,
Laugh with everyone, Tease Giza"

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:16.380
Oh, I didn't do this yet.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:19.132
Next is... stamp.

00:13:21.218 --> 00:13:23.095
Senri! Look, look!

00:13:24.263 --> 00:13:27.349
With this, your hands won't
get dirty, and it's easy to eat.

00:13:27.349 --> 00:13:29.810
It'd be perfect for the event--

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:31.645
Hey, Senri!

00:13:31.645 --> 00:13:34.064
It really is easy to eat.

00:13:35.357 --> 00:13:37.943
I wonder if everyone thinks I'm crazy?

00:13:38.485 --> 00:13:41.655
Crazy? Why?

00:13:43.073 --> 00:13:46.910
You should just do what you want, Senri.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:53.166
There's no one in the Library Club
who will hate you for that.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.255
Kana...

00:13:58.255 --> 00:14:00.257
Senri, there's a crumb on your face.

00:14:00.257 --> 00:14:02.509
Huh? Oh.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.310
This looks great!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:15.397
Oh, it's not done yet.

00:14:15.397 --> 00:14:19.359
Sakuraba, I didn't know
you were good at drawing.

00:14:20.611 --> 00:14:23.572
Oh right, about the color of the logo.

00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:30.913
I thought red would be good
to make "Minafes" stand out,

00:14:30.913 --> 00:14:33.248
but blue might work, too...

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:41.381
I spoke too harshly to Misono before...

00:14:41.381 --> 00:14:45.385
I think it was because part of me was jealous.

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:47.262
Jealous?

00:14:47.262 --> 00:14:52.267
I actually wanted to become an artist,

00:14:52.267 --> 00:14:55.562
but I gave up because
my parents were opposed to it.

00:14:55.562 --> 00:15:01.109
I wasn't strong enough
to overcome their opposition.

00:15:07.074 --> 00:15:12.079
That's why I want Misono to work hard.

00:15:16.834 --> 00:15:23.173
Kakei... Misono is different from me.
I want to support her.

00:15:23.173 --> 00:15:24.633
Yeah.

00:15:26.593 --> 00:15:28.303
You've got mail!

00:15:28.303 --> 00:15:30.430
Oh, I've got an email.

00:15:32.516 --> 00:15:34.142
I wonder who it's from?

00:15:40.607 --> 00:15:42.693
"The Shepherd will
not allow people like you all."

00:15:47.281 --> 00:15:48.907
Kakei.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:59.209
Is it really okay for me to have so much fun?

00:15:59.626 --> 00:16:04.923
Know what? I can read a
book with the future written in it.

00:16:05.841 --> 00:16:11.013
According to that, your future is very bright.

00:16:13.307 --> 00:16:16.852
Oh, you're so bad at jokes.

00:16:17.686 --> 00:16:20.480
But it makes me happy.

00:16:21.106 --> 00:16:24.902
Kakei, please close your eyes for a second.

00:16:24.902 --> 00:16:26.028
Huh?

00:16:26.028 --> 00:16:28.238
Just do it. Quickly.

00:16:29.364 --> 00:16:32.910
Right...

00:16:33.994 --> 00:16:36.205
Okay, you can open them now.

00:16:40.792 --> 00:16:42.419
What did you do?

00:16:55.599 --> 00:16:58.310
You're Kakei, right?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:05.984
There's a crazy rumor going around
that Senri quit singing. Is it true?

00:17:05.984 --> 00:17:12.199
Are you the dear friend Misono
was talking about, Serizawa?

00:17:12.199 --> 00:17:14.243
That's in the past.

00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:25.671
Do you know what happened to
the canary who forgot how to sing?

00:17:35.347 --> 00:17:40.185
Senri Misono. At this rate,
she'll just become an ordinary student.

00:17:40.185 --> 00:17:44.648
She possesses a rare talent
even at the international level.

00:17:44.648 --> 00:17:49.653
You can't give her more time
and watch over her longer?

00:17:49.653 --> 00:17:52.322
Are you in a hurry or something?

00:17:52.322 --> 00:17:55.909
You don't know anything.
Don't act so high and mighty!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:11.425
You've passed the second exam.

00:18:14.052 --> 00:18:18.891
Once you've made your decision,
you can become a Shepherd today if you want.

00:18:18.891 --> 00:18:21.643
What I've been looking
at is your natural talent.

00:18:21.643 --> 00:18:25.856
You can show me results
once you've become a Shepherd.

00:18:45.959 --> 00:18:51.882
It looks like you've taken
over the Senri Misono mission.

00:18:51.882 --> 00:18:55.177
I'm sorry if I overstepped my bounds.

00:18:55.177 --> 00:18:59.348
But Misono is a good friend of mine,
so I couldn't leave it alone.

00:18:59.348 --> 00:19:00.599
It's fine.

00:19:00.599 --> 00:19:06.146
Recently, we've been getting troubling emails
from someone calling themself the Shepherd.

00:19:06.146 --> 00:19:09.691
Well, there are many Shepherds.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.365
Um, about Kodachi...

00:19:16.365 --> 00:19:19.243
Why is she in such a hurry?

00:19:19.243 --> 00:19:24.206
She can't become a Shepherd the way she is now.

00:19:24.206 --> 00:19:27.417
She is competent enough...

00:19:29.253 --> 00:19:32.339
...but it's a matter of her feelings.

00:19:32.339 --> 00:19:36.301
If she doesn't figure them out,
she won't be able to pass.

00:19:36.301 --> 00:19:42.266
I pray that she will realize
herself as soon as possible.

00:19:42.766 --> 00:19:47.354
Will Kodachi continue to
live with people forgetting her?

00:19:48.522 --> 00:19:53.819
This is where her book is.
It's just sealed away.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:20:00.242
If the book is returned,
she will live a normal life,

00:20:00.242 --> 00:20:05.956
even if that is not the
path she would choose herself.

00:20:14.298 --> 00:20:17.342
I'm sorry. Please excuse me for a moment.

00:20:45.996 --> 00:20:48.123
Big Brother Kyotaro.

00:21:05.641 --> 00:21:07.184
Just now...

00:21:07.184 --> 00:21:09.019
What are you doing?

00:21:12.022 --> 00:21:13.565
Nagi...

00:21:25.994 --> 00:21:27.788
You saw?

00:21:27.788 --> 00:21:29.706
You're my...

00:21:32.835 --> 00:21:37.005
Idiot. So you finally remembered?

00:21:37.005 --> 00:21:39.216
Big Brother Kyotaro.

00:21:51.436 --> 00:22:00.153
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>

00:22:00.153 --> 00:22:07.870
<i>While drifting aimlessly, I become an adult</i>

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:17.713
<i>The time has come when days spent</i>
<i>running and playing seem far away</i>

00:22:17.713 --> 00:22:21.967
<i>The answer I gave here</i>

00:22:21.967 --> 00:22:34.897
<i>Oh, if only it had been</i>
<i>passed down somewhere</i>

00:22:34.897 --> 00:22:39.693
<i>For those crowds walking around lost</i>

00:22:39.693 --> 00:22:44.031
<i>It can be a light that shines on them</i>

00:22:44.031 --> 00:22:52.331
<i>On the other side of the</i>
<i>green belt that surrounds us</i>

00:22:52.331 --> 00:23:00.714
<i>You head toward endless tomorrows</i>

00:23:12.768 --> 00:23:15.145
All that fun made me tired.

00:23:15.145 --> 00:23:16.688
Kana, you were playing around too much.

00:23:16.688 --> 00:23:20.776
But an afterschool date with
you would make anyone excited!

00:23:20.776 --> 00:23:22.444
An afterschool date...

00:23:22.444 --> 00:23:24.154
You didn't have fun, Senri?

00:23:24.154 --> 00:23:25.614
I-I did!

00:23:25.614 --> 00:23:27.574
Oh, good!

00:23:27.574 --> 00:23:29.409
If this is a date, then...

00:23:29.409 --> 00:23:31.828
Hey, Kana, close your eyes.

00:23:32.204 --> 00:23:32.829
"Next time: Confession"

00:23:32.829 --> 00:23:33.622
"Next time: Confession"
"Meat"

00:23:33.622 --> 00:23:35.249
"Next time: Confession"
See you!

00:23:35.249 --> 00:23:37.003
"Next time: Confession"
Meat?!
